(7672938, 1252980, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like your photo and I''m glad to see it did well (I didn''t find time to vote this time around).  I''m worried about yours holding up on the validation though.  Georges ran into a problem adding rain to one of his entries, but that was in Standard editing rules.  I am curious as I noticed I had some software I''ve never played with and it has all kinds of ''textures'' that basically do what you''ve done here - added something new on top.  I was going to ask if this was legit in another thread for Standard editing and / or Extended.  Good luck!<br/> <br/>This one ==&gt; <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1230492" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2776/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1230492.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2776/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1230492.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2776/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1230492.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I like your photo and I''m glad to see it did well (I didn''t find time to vote this time around).  I''m worried about yours holding up on the validation though.  Georges ran into a problem adding rain to one of his entries, but that was in Standard editing rules.  I am curious as I noticed I had some software I''ve never played with and it has all kinds of ''textures'' that basically do what you''ve done here - added something new on top.  I was going to ask if this was legit in another thread for Standard editing and / or Extended.  Good luck! This one ==> ', '2020-08-23 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7672955, 1252980, 28742, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, Roz! Congrats on the great finish.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz''s notes:</b></div><hr/><i>ust as a matter of interest ..<br/>when i give my editing steps to the sc for validation i tell them everything i''ve done .. is that the same for other ppl .. ??</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Absolutely not. My editing steps are on a need-to-know basis. The only time I ever revealed my steps was when they waterboarded me and the water tickled my nose and I couldn''t stand it any more. Tell them that magic elves guided your mouse as you edited this masterpiece.</td>', 'Fantastic image, Roz! Congrats on the great finish. Originally posted by roz''s notes:ust as a matter of interest ..when i give my editing steps to the sc for validation i tell them everything i''ve done .. is that the same for other ppl .. ?? Absolutely not. My editing steps are on a need-to-know basis. The only time I ever revealed my steps was when they waterboarded me and the water tickled my nose and I couldn''t stand it any more. Tell them that magic elves guided your mouse as you edited this masterpiece.', '2020-08-23 19:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
