(7673364, 1252980, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic image, Roz! Congrats on the great finish.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz''s notes:</b></div><hr/><i>ust as a matter of interest ..<br/>when i give my editing steps to the sc for validation i tell them everything i''ve done .. is that the same for other ppl .. ??</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Absolutely not. My editing steps are on a need-to-know basis. The only time I ever revealed my steps was when they waterboarded me and the water tickled my nose and I couldn''t stand it any more. Tell them that magic elves guided your mouse as you edited this masterpiece. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL, I''m a minimalist when I explain my editing, bc half the time I can''t even remember, but also bc a lot of it doesn''t need to be told due to the nature of the steps, if you know what I mean :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Fantastic image, Roz! Congrats on the great finish. Originally posted by roz''s notes:ust as a matter of interest ..when i give my editing steps to the sc for validation i tell them everything i''ve done .. is that the same for other ppl .. ?? Absolutely not. My editing steps are on a need-to-know basis. The only time I ever revealed my steps was when they waterboarded me and the water tickled my nose and I couldn''t stand it any more. Tell them that magic elves guided your mouse as you edited this masterpiece.   LOL, I''m a minimalist when I explain my editing, bc half the time I can''t even remember, but also bc a lot of it doesn''t need to be told due to the nature of the steps, if you know what I mean :)', '2020-08-28 00:20:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7673376, 1252980, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic image, Roz! Congrats on the great finish.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz''s notes:</b></div><hr/><i>ust as a matter of interest ..<br/>when i give my editing steps to the sc for validation i tell them everything i''ve done .. is that the same for other ppl .. ??</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Absolutely not. My editing steps are on a need-to-know basis. The only time I ever revealed my steps was when they waterboarded me and the water tickled my nose and I couldn''t stand it any more. Tell them that magic elves guided your mouse as you edited this masterpiece. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL, I''m a minimalist when I explain my editing, bc half the time I can''t even remember, but also bc a lot of it doesn''t need to be told due to the nature of the steps, if you know what I mean :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hahaha Ken .. good answer .. :)<br/>and I will take your method on board Anita  .. i almost don''t want to get in the top five because I''ll have to detail everything I''ve done .. and for some extended edits it can be a lot .. <br/>those sc ppl are probably having a chuckle at my expense.. <br/>not anymore ..!! .. ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Fantastic image, Roz! Congrats on the great finish. Originally posted by roz''s notes:ust as a matter of interest ..when i give my editing steps to the sc for validation i tell them everything i''ve done .. is that the same for other ppl .. ?? Absolutely not. My editing steps are on a need-to-know basis. The only time I ever revealed my steps was when they waterboarded me and the water tickled my nose and I couldn''t stand it any more. Tell them that magic elves guided your mouse as you edited this masterpiece.   LOL, I''m a minimalist when I explain my editing, bc half the time I can''t even remember, but also bc a lot of it doesn''t need to be told due to the nature of the steps, if you know what I mean :)   hahaha Ken .. good answer .. :)and I will take your method on board Anita  .. i almost don''t want to get in the top five because I''ll have to detail everything I''ve done .. and for some extended edits it can be a lot .. those sc ppl are probably having a chuckle at my expense.. not anymore ..!! .. ;)', '2020-08-28 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 0),
